AudioWhisper Keyboard: the `icons` crate

data/sources.tsv holds icon path data from:

  * Google's Material Design Icons, as androidx.compose.material:material-icons-extended
    1.7.8 ships them (https://github.com/google/material-design-icons), Apache-2.0;
  * Pictogrammers' Material Design Icons (https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign),
    Apache-2.0, and FlorisBoard's own vector drawables, Apache-2.0, both as the app's
    drawables hold them.

src ports the code that turned those paths into points on Android, so it is a derivative
work of it: Jetpack Compose's PathParser and toPath (androidx ui-graphics 1.12.1, The
Android Open Source Project, Apache-2.0), Skia's SkPath (Google, BSD-3-Clause) and hwui's
Path.approximate (The Android Open Source Project, Apache-2.0). The Apache-2.0 notice:

